<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica Sigcau plans May 5 privatisation statement.</title>
<headline>SAfrica Sigcau plans May 5 privatisation statement.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public Enterprises Minister Stella Sigcau said on Tuesday she would be updating parliament on plans for the restructuring of state assets, including privatisation, on May 5.</p>
<p>Speaking at the announcement of a shortlist for the privatisation of Sun Air, she declined to give details on other pending selloffs but said she would address this in her budget vote next week.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
